dit trail.","steps":[{"at":"web-ui","action":"Operator saves","detail":"A tenant-scoped token is attached to the request; no API key ever reaches the browser.","tags":[]},{"at":"web-backend","action":"Gateway proxies","detail":"The Rust gateway forwards to the API and keeps upstream addressing server-side.","tags":[]},{"at":"api-guardrails","action":"Guardrails","detail":"Correlation id, access log, log-policy gate and audit event are applied first.","tags":[]},{"at":"api-rest","action":"Authorise","detail":"Fail-closed tenant check: the rule is only touched if it belongs to the caller.","tags":[]},{"at":"core-grpc","action":"RPC","detail":"The write becomes a protobuf call on the engine surface.","tags":[]},{"at":"core-pipeline","action":"Apply","detail":"Optimistic concurrency on the rule version; metadata[content_policy] carries the per-task rules.","tags":[]},{"at":"core-storage","action":"Persist","detail":"Transactional write plus the outbox entry used for audit.","tags":[]},{"at":"logger-svc","action":"Audit","detail":"Before/after images are written to the log store for attribution.","tags":[]}]},{"id":"observe","title":"An event is investigated","summary":"Live logs, the diagnostic window and the dead-letter queue: how an operator answers \"what happened to that message?\".","steps":[{"at":"web-ui","action":"Open the log explorer","detail":"Filters by task, stage, severity and correlation id.","tags":[]},{"at":"web-backend","action":"Stream","detail":"SSE feed so the view updates without polling.","tags":[]},{"at":"api-rest","action":"Query","detail":"Bounded window, tenant-scoped, with redaction already applied upstream.","tags":[]},{"at":"logger-svc","action":"Read","detail":"Field-aware redaction happens at write time, so even an admin read is already safe.","tags":[]},{"at":"logger-store","action":"Return page","detail":"Bounded-label stats and slow-query events are exposed alongside the rows.","tags":[]},{"at":"core-queue","action":"Dead-letter actions","detail":"Inspect, replay or purge failed deliveries for the tenant.","tags":["ENQUEUE_DROP"]}]}]}